# The NestJS generation engine lives in the top-level `api/` folder — a SEPARATE
# application, deployed on its own host (Railway/Render). Exclude ONLY that folder
# from the Vercel (Next.js frontend) build so it isn't type-checked here without
# its own dependencies.
#
# IMPORTANT: the leading slash anchors this to the repo root. A bare `api` would
# (gitignore-style) also match `app/api/` and delete the Next API routes.
/api
